{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-005", "score": 0.116, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-005 | Study family SF-APPA-005: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- observed_research_question: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Playoff defenses change scheme within games and between games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.\n- observed_result: Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 523 cells; 440 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-085", "score": 0.11, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-085 | Study family SF-APPS-085: Connector teammate-path quality Q_p split-half reliability\n- observed_research_question: Connector teammate-path quality Q_p split-half reliability\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector quality Q_p (teammate-initiated on-off PPP gap) is a stable player-season attribute.\n- observed_result: Pearson r(Q_a,Q_b)=+0.215 p=0.0297; Spearman rho=+0.242. Spearman-Brown Q~0.355, S~0.278. Sign agreement 65.7% (67/102) binomial p=0.000996. ICC(player-season)=0.216 (78.4% within). Attenuation: even a perfect predictor  [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: Split-half r=0.215 / SB 0.355 is too low to treat Q_p as a stable scoutable trait; most variance is within-player half-to-half.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=102 connectors\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-086"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-010", "score": 0.079, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-010 | Study family SF-APPS-010: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets\n- observed_research_question: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Play-type PPP (especially DRIVE) declines as a playoff series progresses, so DRIVE is a good early-series call.\n- observed_result: DRIVE 0.889 -> 0.949 (+0.060); CUT +0.114; PNR +0.087; PULL_UP -0.077; POST_UP -0.032.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean\n- observed_failure_evidence: 'NO CLEAR SIGNAL - DRIVE PPP is stable or improves across the series'; observational with selection caveats.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 1197 records; no CIs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Pooled (series, team, PT, bucket) records (1197), EARLY G1-2 / MID G3-4 / LATE G5-7, min 10 poss, min 3 series.\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-029", "score": 0.074, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-029 | Study family SF-PAP-029: Destination outcome (net rating) checks for movers (archive)\n- observed_research_question: Destination outcome (net rating) checks for movers (archive)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Portability relates to destination net rating change.\n- observed_result: 'underpowered and null once corrected for landing-spot quality' (no numbers)\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_power_large_MDE\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: stated underpowered\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-032\n- observed_method: Movers' destination on-court net rating incl. origin-to-destination change.\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- observed_notes: Dropped from Paper 1.\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}], "n_results": 4}

